===Etymology===
{{bor+|pl|gmh|*būding}}.<ref>{{R:pl:Boryś}}</ref><ref name=Bańkowski>{{R:pl:Bańkowski}}</ref> Less likely, from {{af|pl|budować|-unek|nocat=1}} with an unclear shift of ''-unek'' -> ''-ynek'', perhaps either modelled on {{m|pl|pojedynek}} and {{m|pl|spoczynek}},<ref>{{R:pl:Mańczak}}</ref> or from dialectal influence.<ref name=Bańkowski></ref> {{etydate|1600|ref={{R:pl:SXVI|+|45087}}}} Compare {{cog|csb|bùdink}} and {{cog|szl|budōnek}}.

